title: >-
  The Sheffield Ice Velocity ExploreR (SHIVER): A unified
  satellite-derived ice velocity dataset for Earth's ice
  sheets
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata
  from this file.
type: dataset
authors:
